----                              178  
----                              179  ; It is legal, though probably not wise, to have a label with the same name
----                              180  ; as a register.  This looks confusing, but it will work.  All of the examples
----                              181  ; below emit the address of the word at label "SP". None of these have any
----                              182  ; relation to the 65C02 stack pointer.
21AC    00 01                     183  SP     .word      256             ; define a word at location named SP
21AE    AC 21                     184          .word SP                ; store address of "SP" word
21B0    AC 21                     185          .word SP+0
21B2    AC 21                     186          .word 0+SP
